{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27258899","formula":"C₅₂H₆₈N₂O₁₀","hill":"C52H68N2O10","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":52.0,"H":68.0,"N":2.0,"O":10.0},"names":{"en":"Nalbuphine sebacate"},"descriptions":{"en":"Dinalbuphine sebacate (DNS), also known as nalbuphine sebacate or as sebacoyl dinalbuphine ester (SDE) and sold under the brand name Naldebain, is a non-controlled opioid analgesic which is used as a 7-day long-acting injection in the treatment of moderate to severe postoperative pain. The compound is a diester of nalbuphine (Nubain) joined via a sebacic acid linker, and acts as a long-lasting prodrug of nalbuphine via slow hydrolysis. It was developed to extend the duration of action of nalbuphine, which has a short duration and requires frequent injections."},"fame":2,"pubchemCid":9962795,"mass":881.1,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1CC(C1)CN2CC[C@]34[C@@H]5[C@H](CC[C@]3([C@H]2CC6=C4C(=C(C=C6)OC(=O)CCCCCCCCC(=O)OC7=C8C9=C(C[C@@H]1[C@]2([C@]9(CCN1CC1CCC1)[C@@H](O8)[C@H](CC2)O)O)C=C7)O5)O)O","inchikey":"ALOIOAGKUOQNID-ITCIXCFHSA-N","iupac":"bis[(4R,4aS,7S,7aR,12bS)-3-(cyclobutylmethyl)-4a,7-dihydroxy-1,2,4,5,6,7,7a,13-octahydro-4,12-methanobenzofuro[3,2-e]isoquinolin-9-yl] decanedioate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"9962795","atoms":132,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-15.634,"y":-1.248,"z":0.226,"el":"C"},{"x":-15.474,"y":-0.231,"z":1.368,"el":"C"},{"x":-14.227,"y":0.333,"z":0.628,"el":"C"},{"x":-14.842,"y":-0.276,"z":-0.667,"el":"C"},{"x":-12.884,"y":-0.233,"z":1.117,"el":"C"},{"x":-11.757,"y":0.622,"z":0.705,"el":"N"},{"x":-11.37,"y":0.425,"z":-0.7,"el":"C"},{"x":-10.433,"y":-0.764,"z":-0.952,"el":"C"},{"x":-9.254,"y":-0.813,"z":0.043,"el":"C"},{"x":-8.254,"y":-1.925,"z":-0.322,"el":"C"},{"x":-7.634,"y":-2.619,"